WEBVTT

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:00.551
Dodajte 64 i to je 104.

00:03:00.551 --> 00:03:02.203
Sada pogledajte te brojke.

00:03:02.203 --> 00:03:04.587
To nisu Fibonačijevi brojevi,

00:03:04.587 --> 00:03:06.466
ali ako ih pogledate pažljivo,

00:03:06.466 --> 00:03:08.349
videćete Fibonačijeve brojeve

00:03:08.349 --> 00:03:10.527
sakrivene unutar njih.

00:03:10.527 --> 00:03:12.597
Vidite li ih? Pokazaću vam.

00:03:12.597 --> 00:03:16.330
6 je 2 puta 3, 15 je 3 puta 5,

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:18.389
40 je 5 puta 8,

00:03:18.389 --> 00:03:21.317
2, 3, 5, 8.
Kome odajemo priznanje?

00:03:21.317 --> 00:03:22.504
(Smeh)

00:03:22.504 --> 00:03:24.659
Fibonačiju! Naravno.

00:03:24.659 --> 00:03:28.442
Koliko god da je zabavno
otkrivati ove šablone,

00:03:28.442 --> 00:03:30.924
još je veće zadovoljstvo razumeti